@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Production deployment topology
actor "Browser or Git client" as Client
node "Linux reference host" {
  component "Nginx :443" as Nginx
  artifact "React SPA\nfrontend/dist" as SPA
  component "PHP-FPM\nlocal Unix socket" as FPM
  component "Laravel API and Git transport" as API
  database "PostgreSQL\nprivate endpoint" as DB
  component "Controlled Git executable" as Git
  folder "Persistent bare repositories\n/var/lib/gitforge/repositories" as Repos
}
Client --> Nginx : HTTPS
Nginx --> SPA : static assets
Nginx --> FPM : API / Git / health
FPM --> API
API --> DB : metadata
API --> Git : authorized commands
Git --> Repos : Git objects and refs
note bottom of Repos : Persists independently of application releases
@enduml
